  "title": "CAD-to-CAD Proves Critical in Lifesaving Response in Florida",
  "summary": "A CAD-to-CAD interoperability connection between the Titusville Police Department (TPD) and the Brevard County Sheriff’s Office (BCSO) in Florida has demonstrated its critical value in emergency response, directly contributing to a lifesaving medical intervention during a cardiac arrest incident. Both agencies are connected through CAD-to-CAD interoperability with Tyler’s Enterprise Public Safety suite to improve real-time sharing of emergency call-for-service data between agencies,...",
